  = note: attach the handler from a `<script>` in the template (it gets the CSP nonce), e.g. `el.addEventListener("click", ...)`
  = note: or allow inline code with `[security] csp` in phv.toml (not recommended)

warning: `javascript:` URLs do not run under the default Content-Security-Policy
 --> csp_inline.phv:6:9
  |
6 | <a href="javascript:history.back()">Back</a>
