  = note: use a button with an event listener added from a `<script>` in the template
  = note: or allow inline code with `[security] csp` in phv.toml (not recommended)

<button onclick="save()">Save</button>
<a href="javascript:history.back()">Back</a>
<img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgo=" alt="">
<p onclick-free="1" title="on">fine</p>
<script>document.querySelector("button").addEventListener("click", () => save(3));</script>
